      "comment": "MR. OBERON (6) is a well performed dog who recorded his 17th career win last time out at this track (16.55). Form here at this distance is sound. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Will go close again if runs up to latest. MICKEY HALLER (8) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Brother Bilo (19.33) in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Can feature again. CHAOTIC BOY (2) turned in a fair 4th placed finish last time at Murray Bridge over 350m (19.46). Strike rate this course and distance strong having won four of six tries. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. TAKE THE STEPS (4) warrants respect following a recent placing from the same draw.",
